{
 "kind": 1,
 "value": "## 17. Superseded by the clean bracket construction\n\nThe exploratory definitions above are retained as an audit trail. The final formula, its exact diagonal identity, self-adjoint Baxter proof, Pluecker form, factorizing-twist intertwiner, explicit monodromy, and four-state numerical verification have been rewritten without the intermediate `a,b,c,d` evaluations in `Baxter_Mellin_Wavefunction_L2_Clean.wb`.",
